    "Bh6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The queen has strayed into a trap, and the way to free it is to lean on the fact that it pins a piece — a bishop to h6 exploits the pin and essentially forces the queens off. Use the very pin that looks awkward as the lever that saves the piece.",
   "kind": "tactic"
