   ],
   "spoken": "The knight lunge eyes the f2 square, and there are two ways to defend — a rook step or a knight to the edge. Prefer the rook, because you never want a knight consigned to the rim purely to babysit a pawn; the intruder can be shooed away by a pawn later.",
